  "description": "<p>When trying to update pairtree elements, a 403 should be returned...<br/>\nsuch as in the following interaction:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>/rest/ container has 0 children<br/>\n<span class=\"error\">&#91;azaroth@localhost fedora4&#93;</span>$ curl -X POST --data @temp.ttl <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/</a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/70/9d/63/00/709d6300-e65d-470e-8982-996eefbdf810\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/70/9d/63/00/709d6300-e65d-470e-8982-996eefbdf810</a></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>/rest/ container now has 1 child<br/>\n<span class=\"error\">&#91;azaroth@localhost fedora4&#93;</span>$ curl -X POST --data @temp.ttl <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/70/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/70/</a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/70/ea/e2/20/ff/eae220ff-ebed-42a3-ad7a-ef0be4cbf939\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/70/ea/e2/20/ff/eae220ff-ebed-42a3-ad7a-ef0be4cbf939</a></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>/rest/ container now has two children, even though I posted to a different container <img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/sad.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"/></li>\n</ol>\n",
